The '''Magma Boss''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|boss}} found in the {{Zone|Magma Chamber}} of the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Magma Boss''' spawns every 2 minutes at the center lava pool. The spawn time is identical in every server.

== Behavior ==
The '''Magma Boss''' has 3 states: normal, split, and fleeing.

The normal state occurs when the '''Magma Boss''' is not in any other states. The split state occurs every time the boss has taken {{Stat|dmg|32M}} (at {{Stat|hp|128M|icononly=y}}, {{Stat|hp|96M|icononly=y}}, {{Stat|hp|64M|icononly=y}}, {{Stat|hp|32M|icononly=y}}{{Confirm}} and {{Stat|hp|0M<!-- TODO: Is this meant to be 0, or something else? -->|icononly=y}}). The flee state occurs after the last split.

During the normal state, the '''Magma Boss''' can do the following:
*Shoot a fireball at a nearby player every second, which deals {{Stat|dmg}} on hit.
*Create a circle of fire particles on the ground.
*Jump into the air and land in the circle of fire, crushing all players beneath.
**Before landing, the '''Magma Boss''' launches {{Green|3}} projectiles towards the opposite side of the arena. Upon touching the ground, they create large areas of fire particles which deal {{Stat|dmg}} to players standing in them every {{Green|0.5}} seconds. They disappear before the '''Magma Boss''' jumps again.

The "'''Damage Soaked'''" by the '''Magma Boss''' can be seen as a meter on the scoreboard. It can alter its damage increase per cycle if filled and can be filled multiple times over with different effects and thresholds:
*Yellow is the basic requirement to enter the split phase. It increases the '''Magma Boss's''' damage by {{Stat|dmg|+20%}}.
*Orange is the second threshold. It increases damage by {{Stat|dmg|+25%}}.
*Red is the final threshold. It increases damage by {{Stat|dmg|+35%}}.
The '''Magma Boss''' always jumps at least {{Green|3}} times before entering its split state.

During the split state, the '''Magma Boss''' jumps to the center of the arena and splits into many {{MobSprite|Magma Glare;Magma Glares}} and {{MobSprite|Unstable Magma;Unstable Magmas}}.
*{{MobSprite|Magma Glare;Magma Glares}} target the nearest player and shoots fireballs. They can also deal {{stat|dmg}} on contact. Each {{MobSprite|Magma Glare}} targeting a player increases the damage taken from them and {{MobSprite|Unstable Magma;Unstable Magmas}}.
**This can be calculated with <math>\text{DamageMultiplier} = 2 * \text{TargetingMagmaGlares}</math>. The maximum multiplier is {{Green|14}}.
*{{MobSprite|Unstable Magma;Unstable Magmas}} jump towards the player to deal {{Stat|dmg}} on hit.

The scoreboard will have the "'''Kill the Magmas'''" meter showing the amount of mobs required to kill. Once filled, the '''Magma Boss''' will return to its normal state. It will announce in chat the amount of {{Stat|damage}} increase as it reforms. 

When the '''Magma Boss''' reaches a cumulative {{Stat|dmg|+100%}} or more, it will enter its final flee state. During this state, the '''Magma Boss''' shrinks and is set to {{Stat|hp|10M}}. It runs away from players while shooting fireballs. As its {{Stat|hp}} decreases, it moves faster and continues to shrink.

